comments.body:
@AndrewRosen Would you be able to take a look to see if it solves the plotting issue?

I wonder if checking the envvar is the best way.  One could also import matplotlib and then call get_backend().  Maybe the docs have something to say about it.

This check by itself is a little bit difficult to understand (if I accidentally revert the change then "everything works for me").  We'd need some explanatory comments to protect against that (even better would be tests, but that may be tricky and we may not have all the infrastructure needed for the test)
